<title>JAPAN: Nippon Mining opens Singapore, Santiago offices.</title>
<headline>Nippon Mining opens Singapore, Santiago offices.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Mining and Metals Co said on Tuesday it had opened offices in Singapore and Santiago, Chile.</p>
<p>The Singapore office will focus on gathering information and promoting sales and procurement activity in the growing Southeast Asian market. The Santiago office will support copper mining development projects in Chile and gather information about mining activities throughout the region.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodities Desk (81-3 3432 6179)</p>
</text>
